    </terminology_id>
    <code_string>en</code_string>
  </language>
  <description>
    <original_author id="name">Erik Sundvall / RCC Genomik (draft)</original_author>
    <original_author id="organisation">Regionala cancercentrum i samverkan</original_author>
    <original_author id="date">2026-10-15</original_author>
    <lifecycle_state>unmanaged</lifecycle_state>
    <other_details id="Generated By">Ehrtslib ADL2 template → OPT 1.4 exporter</other_details>
    <details>
      <language>
        <terminology_id>
          <value>ISO_639-1</value>
        </terminology_id>
        <code_string>en</code_string>
      </language>
      <purpose>Swedish RCC genomics service request / referral (T2 Genomikremiss). Managed Response composition: request + service_request (remiss_id, frågeställning / clinical indication, service name) and problem_diagnosis (ICD-10). Receiving organisation optional under service_request protocol.</purpose>
      <keywords>genomics</keywords>
      <keywords>request</keywords>
      <keywords>referral</keywords>
      <keywords>RCC</keywords>
      <keywords>remiss</keywords>
      <use>Frågeställning is bound to local codes from valuesets/fragestallning.json in the service_request overlay. Mirror remiss_id into report protocol Requester order identifier when fulfilling.</use>
      <copyright>© Regionala cancercentrum i samverkan</copyright>
    </details>
    <details>
      <language>
        <terminology_id>
          <value>ISO_639-1</value>
        </terminology_id>
        <code_string>sv</code_string>
      </language>
      <purpose>Svensk RCC genomikremiss (T2). Managed Response: request + tjänstebegäran (remiss_id, frågeställning) och problem_diagnosis (ICD-10).</purpose>
      <keywords>genomik</keywords>
      <keywords>remiss</keywords>
      <keywords>RCC</keywords>
      <use>Frågeställning är bunden till lokala koder (valuesets/fragestallning.json). Spegla remiss_id till rapportens Requester order identifier vid svar.</use>
      <copyright>© Regionala cancercentrum i samverkan</copyright>
    </details>
  </description>
